# Content writing rules
- Always follow tone of voice to write copy
- Always keep manifest in mind 


# Tone of voice
- Short and strong sentences
- Confident and calm voice
- Easy to read. Never use uncommon words
- Use oxford 10000 words 
- Never write salesy, pushing text
- Be calm and confident
- Better to keep space clean then write unmeaningful text
- If we need overexplain — we do something wrong


